09. SOURCE REGISTRY

Every source MUST possess a canonical source record.

{
  "source_id": "immutable-identifier",
  "source_type": "api|dataset|document|feed|web",
  "provider_id": "provider",
  "canonical_uri": "source-reference",
  "access_class": "public|authorized",
  "authorization_basis": "documented-basis",
  "terms_reference": "reference",
  "license_reference": "reference",
  "connector_id": "connector",
  "connector_version": "version",
  "schema_version": "version",
  "status": "active|suspended|retired",
  "first_seen": "RFC3339",
  "last_validated": "RFC3339",
  "provenance_policy": "policy-id"
}

No unregistered source may execute.

