---

15. CRYPTOGRAPHIC INTEGRITY

Minimum integrity requirements:

HASH_ALGORITHM="SHA-256"

CONTENT_HASH_REQUIRED="true"

ARTIFACT_HASH_REQUIRED="true"

MANIFEST_HASH_REQUIRED="true"

CONFIG_HASH_REQUIRED="true"

LINEAGE_HASH_REQUIRED="true"

HASH_CHAIN_ENABLED="true"

SIGNATURE_SUPPORT_ENABLED="${SIGNATURE_SUPPORT_ENABLED}"

Where appropriate:

artifact_n
    |
    v
hash(artifact_n)
    |
    v
manifest
    |
    v
manifest hash

The hash establishes integrity of the represented bytes.

It does NOT independently establish:

truth
authenticity of the source
legality
intent
causation
identity

Those require separate evidence.

